# Collect visible Karpathy X posts with your signed-in Chrome

Free local Python + Playwright. Connects to **your existing Chrome CDP session at localhost:9223**. It creates and navigates its own scratch tab, leaving existing tabs intact. It does not export cookies, use private X endpoints, launch another profile, or install stealth/proxy tooling.

The requested default range is **2023-10-08 through 2026-10-08 inclusive**. Search queries use an exclusive `until:2026-10-09`. Weekly windows covering 2024-08 through 2024-11 run first. When a window hits the scroll budget or stalls, it is divided into smaller windows down to a single day. All results include replies surfaced by `from:karpathy`;
